<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,maximum-scale=1,user-scalable=no">
<title>Rattana Bplus Sales v4.2</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sarabun:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.0/dist/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#f0f4f1;--card:#ffffff;--hero:#0d2416;
  --green:#00b14f;--green-light:#e8f7ef;
  --blue:#1a6fb8;--amber:#f59e0b;--red:#ef4444;--purple:#8b5cf6;
  --text:#0d1a0f;--text2:#3d5442;--muted:#8a9e8f;--border:#e0eae3;
  --bottom-h:70px;--safe-bot:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px);
  --radius-sm:10px;--radius-md:16px;--radius-lg:22px;--radius-xl:28px;
}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
html,body{height:100%;overflow:hidden}
body{font-family:'Sarabun',sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;max-width:430px;margin:0 auto;position:relative}
.scroll-area{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;overflow-x:hidden;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;
  padding-bottom:calc(var(--bottom-h) + var(--safe-bot) + 16px);scroll-behavior:smooth}
.scroll-area::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
.status-bar{height:max(44px,env(safe-area-inset-top));background:var(--bg);flex-shrink:0}
.app-header{padding:0 20px 14px;background:var(--bg);flex-shrink:0}
.header-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
.greeting{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500}
.greeting b{color:var(--text);font-weight:700}
.icon-btn{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--card);border:none;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px;
  box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.08);cursor:pointer;flex-shrink:0}
.page-title{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--text);margin-top:4px;letter-spacing:-.3px}
.wh-bar{display:flex;gap:7px;padding:0 20px 14px;flex-shrink:0;overflow-x:auto}
.wh-bar::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
.wh-chip{padding:7px 16px;border-radius:20px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;
  border:1.5px solid var(--border);background:var(--card);color:var(--muted);
  cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;transition:all .18s;flex-shrink:0;font-family:inherit}
.wh-chip.active{background:var(--green);border-color:var(--green);color:#fff}
/* Hero */
.hero-card{margin:0 16px 14px;border-radius:var(--radius-xl);background:var(--hero);
  padding:22px 22px 18px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;flex-shrink:0}
.hero-card::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-40px;right:-30px;width:160px;height:160px;
  border-radius:50%;background:rgba(0,177,79,.12)}
.hero-card::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:-50px;left:20px;width:120px;height:120px;
  border-radius:50%;background:rgba(0,230,118,.07)}
.hero-date{font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);font-weight:500;margin-bottom:8px}
.hero-amount{font-size:40px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-1px;line-height:1;margin-bottom:6px}
.hero-amount span{font-size:24px;font-weight:600;margin-right:2px;opacity:.85}
.hero-meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.hero-meta-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6)}
.hero-meta-item b{color:rgba(255,255,255,.95);font-weight:700}
/* Hero target */
.hero-target-wrap{margin-bottom:14px;display:none}
.hero-target-wrap.show{display:block}
.hero-target-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:5px}
.hero-target-label{font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);font-weight:600}
.hero-target-pct{font-size:13px;font-weight:800}
.hero-target-track{height:6px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden}
.hero-target-bar{height:6px;border-radius:3px;transition:width .6s}
.hero-target-sub{font-size:10px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.4);margin-top:4px;font-weight:500}
.hero-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1)}
.hero-stat{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}
.hero-stat-label{font-size:10px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.45);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px}
.hero-stat-val{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#fff}
.hero-stat-val.up{color:#00e676}
.hero-stat-val.down{color:#ff6b6b}
.hero-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;background:rgba(0,177,79,.25);
  border:1px solid rgba(0,230,118,.3);border-radius:20px;padding:3px 10px;font-size:11px;
  color:#00e676;font-weight:700;position:absolute;top:22px;right:22px}
.period-tabs{display:flex;background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);
  margin:0 16px 16px;padding:4px;gap:2px;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.06);flex-shrink:0}
.period-btn{flex:1;padding:9px 0;border-radius:var(--radius-md);border:none;
  font-size:13px;font-weight:600;font-family:inherit;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;
  background:transparent;color:var(--muted)}
.period-btn.active{background:var(--green);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,177,79,.35)}
.section{padding:0 16px;margin-bottom:16px}
.section-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:12px}
.section-title{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text)}
.section-link{font-size:12px;color:var(--green);font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
/* Cat item + target */
.cat-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
.cat-item{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:14px 16px;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.05)}
.cat-item-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
.cat-icon{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:20px;flex-shrink:0}
.cat-info{flex:1;min-width:0}
.cat-name{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.cat-txn{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:1px;font-weight:500}
.cat-amount{text-align:right;flex-shrink:0}
.cat-baht{font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--text)}
.cat-cs{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:1px}
.cat-baht.zero{color:var(--muted)}
.cat-target-section{margin-top:10px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);display:none}
.cat-target-section.show{display:block}
.cat-target-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:5px}
.cat-target-label{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.3px}
.cat-target-pct{font-size:12px;font-weight:800}
.pct-ok{color:var(--green)}.pct-warn{color:var(--amber)}.pct-low{color:var(--red)}
.cat-target-track{height:5px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden}
.cat-target-bar{height:5px;border-radius:3px;transition:width .5s}
.cat-target-txt{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px;font-weight:500}
/* Charts */
.chart-card{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);padding:18px;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.05)}
.chart-wrap{height:140px;position:relative}
.big-chart-wrap{height:240px;position:relative}
/* Nav */
.bottom-nav{height:calc(var(--bottom-h) + var(--safe-bot));background:var(--card);
  border-top:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;align-items:flex-start;
  padding-top:8px;flex-shrink:0;position:sticky;bottom:0;z-index:50;overflow-x:auto;gap:0}
.bottom-nav::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
.nav-btn{flex:1;min-width:60px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:3px;
  border:none;background:transparent;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;padding:4px 0}
.nav-icon{font-size:20px;line-height:1}
.nav-label{font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);transition:color .15s;white-space:nowrap}
.nav-btn.active .nav-label{color:var(--green)}
.nav-btn.active .nav-icon{filter:drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(0,177,79,.5))}
.nav-dot{width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);margin:0 auto;opacity:0;transition:opacity .2s}
.nav-btn.active .nav-dot{opacity:1}
.page{display:none;flex-direction:column;height:100%}
.page.active{display:flex}
/* Reports */
.stat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}
.stat-card{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.05)}
.stat-card-label{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.3px;margin-bottom:4px}
.stat-card-val{font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:var(--text)}
/* Target cards (Reports) */
.target-card{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:16px;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.05);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
.target-card-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.target-card-icon{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px;flex-shrink:0}
.target-card-name{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);flex:1}
.target-card-pct{font-size:18px;font-weight:800;flex-shrink:0}
.target-track{height:8px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden}
.target-bar{height:8px;border-radius:4px;transition:width .6s}
.target-foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline}
.target-actual{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text)}
.target-goal{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}
.target-remain-ok{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--green);text-align:right}
.target-remain-need{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--red);text-align:right}
/* Products */
.search-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius-md);
  padding:0 14px;gap:8px;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.05);margin-bottom:12px}
.search-bar input{flex:1;border:none;outline:none;font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;
  padding:12px 0;background:transparent;color:var(--text)}
.search-bar input::placeholder{color:var(--muted)}
.product-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.product-item{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:12px 14px;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.04)}
.product-left{flex:1;min-width:0}
.product-name{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.product-cat{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}
.product-right{text-align:right;flex-shrink:0;margin-left:12px}
.product-baht{font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:var(--text)}
.product-cs{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}
/* Stock */
.stock-hero-card{margin:0 16px 16px;border-radius:var(--radius-xl);
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0d2416 0%,#1a4a2e 100%);padding:22px 22px 18px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.stock-hero-card::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-40px;right:-30px;width:160px;height:160px;
  border-radius:50%;background:rgba(0,177,79,.15)}
.stock-hero-sub{font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px}
.stock-hero-big{font-size:44px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-1.5px;line-height:1;margin-bottom:4px}
.stock-hero-meta{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1)}
.stock-hero-meta-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6)}
.stock-hero-meta-item b{color:#fff;font-weight:700}
.stock-cat-item{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:14px 16px;
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.05);
  margin-bottom:10px;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .12s}
.stock-cat-item:active{transform:scale(.98)}
.stock-cat-icon{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px;flex-shrink:0}
.stock-cat-body{flex:1;min-width:0}
.stock-cat-name{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:4px}
.stock-cat-sku{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500;margin-bottom:6px}
.stock-progress-track{height:4px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden}
.stock-progress-bar{height:4px;border-radius:2px;transition:width .4s}
.stock-cat-right{text-align:right;flex-shrink:0;margin-left:10px}
.stock-cat-val{font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:var(--text)}
.stock-cat-arrow{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}
.stock-prod-card{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius-md);box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.06);margin-bottom:10px;overflow:hidden}
.stock-prod-header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 14px 10px}
.stock-prod-name{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);flex:1;min-width:0;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;margin-right:10px}
.stock-prod-total-badge{flex-shrink:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;gap:1px}
.stock-prod-total-num{font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:var(--text)}
.stock-prod-total-label{font-size:9px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.3px;text-transform:uppercase}
.stock-wh-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--border);border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.stock-wh-cell{background:var(--card);padding:8px 6px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:4px}
.stock-wh-label{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:6px;letter-spacing:.3px}
.stock-wh-num{font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:var(--text);line-height:1}
.stock-wh-unit{font-size:9px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
.stock-wh-bar-track{width:20px;height:44px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:flex-end}
.stock-wh-bar-fill{width:100%;border-radius:4px;transition:height .4s}
.stock-wh-cell.zero .stock-wh-num{color:var(--muted)}
.stock-wh-cell.zero .stock-wh-label{opacity:.5}
.wh-w1{background:#fde8e8;color:#c0392b}.wh-w2{background:#dbeafe;color:#1d4ed8}
.wh-w3{background:#fde8e8;color:#c0392b}.wh-w4{background:#e8f7ef;color:#1e8449}
.bar-w1{background:#ef4444}.bar-w2{background:#3b82f6}
.bar-w3{background:#ef4444}.bar-w4{background:#00b14f}
.stock-filter-bar{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.stock-filter-chip{padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;
  border:1.5px solid var(--border);background:var(--card);color:var(--muted);
  cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;font-family:inherit;transition:all .18s}
.stock-filter-chip.active{background:var(--green);border-color:var(--green);color:#fff}
.stock-filter-chip.active-out{background:#ef4444;border-color:#ef4444;color:#fff}
/* Spinner */
.spinner-overlay{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(13,26,15,.6);align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:999;backdrop-filter:blur(4px)}
.spinner-overlay.show{display:flex}
.spinner-box{background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:24px 32px;text-align:center;border-top:3px solid var(--green)}
.spin{width:40px;height:40px;border:4px solid #e0eae3;border-top-color:var(--green);border-radius:50%;animation:spin .7s linear infinite;margin:0 auto 12px}
.spin-txt{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
/* Toast */
.toast{position:fixed;top:max(60px,env(safe-area-inset-top));left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);
  padding:10px 20px;border-radius:20px;color:#fff;z-index:9999;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;
  white-space:nowrap;animation:toastIn .3s ease;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}
.toast-ok{background:var(--green)}.toast-err{background:var(--red)}
@keyframes toastIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(-10px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0)}}
/* Upload */
.upload-overlay{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(13,26,15,.75);align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:998;padding:20px;backdrop-filter:blur(5px)}
.upload-overlay.show{display:flex}
.upload-box{background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:28px 24px;width:100%;max-width:340px;text-align:center}
.upload-box h3{font-size:16px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:8px}
.upload-box p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:18px}
.upload-steps{background:var(--bg);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;text-align:left;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:16px}
.upload-label{display:block;background:var(--green);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:13px;border-radius:12px;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;margin-bottom:8px}
.upload-cancel{background:none;border:1.5px solid var(--border);color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;padding:10px;border-radius:12px;cursor:pointer;width:100%;font-family:inherit}
.num{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.empty{text-align:center;padding:40px 20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
.loading-stock{text-align:center;padding:30px 20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
@media(min-width:431px){body{border-left:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-right:1px solid #e0e0e0;box-shadow:0 0 40px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="spinner-overlay" id="spinner"><div class="spinner-box"><div class="spin"></div><div class="spin-txt" id="spinTxt">กำลังโหลดข้อมูล...</div></div></div>
<div class="upload-overlay" id="uploadOverlay">
  <div class="upload-box">
    <div style="font-size:40px;margin-bottom:10px">📂</div>
    <h3>โหลดข้อมูลไม่ได้</h3>
    <p>กรุณา Export CSV จากชีต SQLBP แล้วอัปโหลดแทนครับ</p>
    <div class="upload-steps"><b style="color:var(--text)">วิธี Export CSV:</b><br>1. เปิด Google Sheets → ชีต SQLBP<br>2. ไฟล์ → ดาวน์โหลด → CSV<br>3. กด "เลือกไฟล์" ด้านล่าง</div>
    <label class="upload-label">📂 เลือกไฟล์ CSV (SQLBP)<input type="file" accept=".csv" style="display:none" id="csvInput"></label>
    <button class="upload-cancel" id="uploadCancel">ยกเลิก</button>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="status-bar"></div>

<!-- HOME -->
<div class="page active" id="pageHome">
  <div class="app-header">
    <div class="header-row">
      <div><div class="greeting">สวัสดี <b>rattana.phai</b> 👋</div><div class="page-title" id="homeTitle">ยอดขายวันนี้</div></div>
      <button class="icon-btn" id="refreshBtn">↻</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wh-bar">
    <button class="wh-chip active" data-wh="all">ทั้งหมด</button>
    <button class="wh-chip" data-wh="W1">W1</button><button class="wh-chip" data-wh="W2">W2</button>
    <button class="wh-chip" data-wh="W3">W3</button><button class="wh-chip" data-wh="W4">W4</button>
  </div>
  <div class="scroll-area">
    <div class="hero-card">
      <div class="hero-badge" id="heroBadge">📊 GAS</div>
      <div class="hero-date" id="heroDate">—</div>
      <div class="hero-amount num"><span>฿</span><span id="heroAmount">0</span></div>
      <div class="hero-meta">
        <div class="hero-meta-item">📦 <b id="heroCs">0</b> ลัง</div>
        <div class="hero-meta-item">🧾 <b id="heroTxn">0</b> รายการ</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-target-wrap" id="heroTargetWrap">
        <div class="hero-target-row">
          <span class="hero-target-label">🎯 เป้าเดือนนี้</span>
          <span class="hero-target-pct num" id="heroTargetPct">—</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-target-track"><div class="hero-target-bar" id="heroTargetBar" style="width:0%"></div></div>
        <div class="hero-target-sub num" id="heroTargetSub"></div>
      </div>
